## See it from the water

The canal ring begins a short ride north of the hotel, and an hour on a boat rearranges how the whole place fits together. Go at dusk if you can, when the bridges are lit. Reception books the cruises and can tell you which departure points are worth the extra ten minutes on the tram.

*Photo: Hermann Luyken, CC0, via Wikimedia Commons.*
